message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and also cite the source table (NEPA-UNICAMP, 2011)."
type: dataset
title: "taco-rdf: the Brazilian Food Composition Table (TACO) as an RDF knowledge graph"
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22920219
date-released: 2026-09-23
authors:
  - family-names: Maia
    given-names: Vitória
    email: vitoriamaia19@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Victoria125/taco-rdf"
url: "https://w3id.org/taco-rdf/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - food composition
  - TACO
  - Brazil
  - knowledge graph
  - RDF
  - FoodOn
  - ChEBI
  - CDNO
  - Food Item Ontology
  - QUDT
  - SHACL
  - ODRL
  - FAIR data
abstract: >-
  The Brazilian Food Composition Table (TACO, 4th edition, NEPA-UNICAMP 2011) as an RDF knowledge graph:
  597 foods in 15 groups with 21,150 nutrient measurements, typed with FoodOn and the Food Item Ontology,
  aligned to ChEBI, CDNO and QUDT, validated
  with SHACL, with PROV-O provenance and an ODRL attribution policy.
references:
  - type: book
    title: "Tabela brasileira de composição de alimentos - TACO"
    edition: "4. ed. rev. e ampl."
    authors:
